<p>See also <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Custom%20AI" title="Custom AI">Custom AI</a> for a means of overriding creature AI directly on a lower level.
</p><p>The core AI scripts that control what a creature does makes use of a large set of variables in the default <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Local%20variable" title="Var creature.xls">var_creature.xls</a> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Local%20variable" title="Local variable">local variable</a> table. The variables and their affects are: <br clear="all" />
</p>
